    "description": "Operator got the contact treatment on Aug 17; Partner still needs it. Add both lookups to the Partner page and surface email/phone as relationship fields rather than custom fields.\n\n=== IMPLEMENTATION REQUIREMENTS ===\n\n* Add Primary Contact and Billing Contact lookups to the Partner Lightning page.\n\n* Add Primary Contact -> Email and Primary Contact -> Phone as cross-object relationship fields, read-only. Do not create standalone email/phone fields — the Operator equivalents were deleted for exactly this reason.\n\n* Billing Email stays its own custom field.\n\n* No lookup filters for now. Kobi noted the tool for later: 'accounts, we have both player, operator, referrer, partner, they're all accounts. So when we have lookup fields for account and we only want to see operator values, that's where the lookup filter will come in. So for now there's nothing necessary here but in the future, heads up.'\n\n=== NOTES ===\n\n* Explicitly on Taryn's outstanding list from the Aug 17 call.\n\n* Child relationship naming: Operator used Accounts_Primary and Accounts_Billing. Keep it consistent.\n\n=== SOURCE ===\n\n* Aug 17 call — Taryn's outstanding items\n\nDependencies: BUILD-136\n\nOwner (proposed): Taryn Reithofer\n\nRemember to update the requirements documentation as part of this change.\n\nCreated 2026-08-17 from the Operator/Partner ticket review, approved by Kobi.",
